    "content": "\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"border-b border-slate-200 pb-2\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-900\">Mengapa Microsoft Excel Menjadi Alat Utama Desa?</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Ketersediaan aplikasi tanpa perlu koneksi internet stabil (100% offline), fleksibel, dan kompatibel dengan sistem BPS.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"space-y-2.5\">\n        <div class=\"text-xs font-black text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wide\">5 Standar Kompetensi Wajib Operator DESCAN:</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 text-xs\">\n            <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-2.5\">\n                <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 text-[#005ea6] font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs\">1</span>\n                <div>\n                    <b>Struktur Tabel Bersih (Tabular Standard)</b>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-[11px] mt-0.5\">Membuat tabel database tanpa sel gabungan (no merge cells) agar rumus bekerja akurat.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-2.5\">\n                <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs\">2</span>\n                <div>\n                    <b>Keamanan NIK & Validasi Input</b>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-[11px] mt-0.5\">Mencegah NIK 16 digit terpotong/berubah saintifik dan menerapkan dropdown pilihan.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-2.5\">\n                <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs\">3</span>\n                <div>\n                    <b>Penguasaan Rumus Logika & Statistik</b>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-[11px] mt-0.5\">Menguasai SUMIF, COUNTIFS, IF, AND, OR untuk seleksi bansos dan profil monografi.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 flex items-start gap-2.5\">\n                <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 font-black flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-xs\">4</span>\n                <div>\n                    <b>Relasi Lintas Tabel (VLOOKUP & MATCH)</b>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-500 text-[11px] mt-0.5\">Menghubungkan data kependudukan desa dengan data DTKS Kemensos secara instan.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 text-xs text-rose-900\">\n        <b>⚠️ Etika Kerahasiaan Data (UU Perlindungan Data Pribadi No. 27/2022):</b>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-rose-700 mt-0.5\">Nomor NIK, kondisi medis, dan nominal bansos warga adalah data sensitif. Jangan pernah mengunggah file mentah Excel ke grup publik WhatsApp atau media sosial.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n"
