    "badge": "Bagian I • Dasar",
    "content": "\n<div class=\"space-y-4\">\n    <div class=\"border-b border-slate-200 pb-2\">\n        <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black text-slate-900\">Aturan Baku Struktur Tabel Data Desa (Prinsip SDI)</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Perbedaan antara tabel input data mentah (database) dan tabel laporan akhir (monografi cetak).</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n        <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 text-rose-900\">\n            <span class=\"font-black text-sm flex items-center gap-1\">❌ Dilarang (Kesalahan Fatal):</span>\n            <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-[11px] mt-1.5 text-rose-800\">\n                <li>Menggabungkan sel (<b>Merge & Center</b>) pada baris data warga.</li>\n                <li>Menyisipkan baris kosong sebagai pemisah dusun.</li>\n                <li>Menaruh beberapa informasi dalam 1 kolom (misal: \"Kolaka, 12-04-1990\").</li>\n                <li>Membuat total di tengah-tengah tabel data mentah.</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-900\">\n            <span class=\"font-black text-sm flex items-center gap-1\">✅ Standar BPS (Tabular):</span>\n            <ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-[11px] mt-1.5 text-emerald-800\">\n                <li><b>1 Baris = 1 Entitas</b> (satu warga atau satu keluarga).</li>\n                <li><b>1 Kolom = 1 Variabel</b> (misal: Kolom NIK, Nama, Tanggal Lahir).</li>\n                <li>Baris pertama selalu berisi judul kolom (Header) yang jelas.</li>\n                <li>Gunakan huruf kecil atau tanda strip bawah (misal: <code class=\"bg-emerald-100 px-1 rounded\">No_KK</code>, bukan spasi liar).</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-xs text-left border border-slate-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 font-black\">\n                <tr>\n                    <th class=\"p-2 border\">No</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-2 border\">No_KK</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-2 border\">NIK</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-2 border\">Nama_Lengkap</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-2 border\">Jenis_Kelamin</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-2 border\">Dusun</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-2 border\">Pekerjaan</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody class=\"text-slate-600\">\n                <tr class=\"hover:bg-slate-50\">\n                    <td class=\"p-2 border\">1</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-2 border font-mono\">7408012001000001</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-2 border font-mono\">7408011405900001</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-2 border font-bold\">Warga Contoh</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-2 border\">Laki-laki</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-2 border\">Dusun I</td>\n                    <td class=\"p-2 border\">Petani Kakao</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n</div>\n"
